{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)clearNotificationCenter","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"clearNotificationCenter","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Clears all delivered notifications from the notification center."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes all notifications delivered by your app from the iOS Notification Center."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is commonly used when:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"User opens the app (clear notifications since they’re viewing content)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User logs out (clear notifications for privacy)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content is marked as read in-app"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Performing a “mark all as read” action","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only removes notifications from your app; other apps’ notifications are unaffected.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Clear notifications on app activation and logout:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class NotificationManager {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications when user opens app","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Also reset badge","        UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = 0","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","","    func handleUserLogout() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications for privacy","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Unregister from push","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { _ in }","","        \/\/ Reset the user identity to the HWID","        Pushwoosh.configure.resetUserId()","    }","","    func markAllAsRead() {","        \/\/ Clear from notification center","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Update backend","        APIClient.shared.markAllNotificationsRead { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear badge","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/clearnotificationcenter"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/clearNotificationCenter"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.Pushwoos